            # TLDR: Rescale sw to sum up to n_samples.
            # Long: The objective function of Enet
            #
            #    1/2 * np.average(squared error, weights=sw)
            #    + alpha * penalty                                             (1)
            #
            # is invariant under rescaling of sw.
            # But enet_path coordinate descent minimizes
