    The Python source code to execute.
pattern : str
    Pattern that the stdout + stderr should not match. By default, unless
    stdout + stderr are both empty, an error will be raised.","1","parameter_missing","Function signature contains parameter 'timeout' which is undocumented in the docstring.","train"
"semdrift_drift_002011","scikit-learn","master_head","scikit-learn/sklearn/calibration.py","from_estimator","def from_estimator(
        cls,
        estimator,
