    Examples
    --------
    >>> ensure_index_from_sequences([[1, 2, 4]], names=[""name""])
    Index([1, 2, 4], dtype='int64', name='name')

    >>> ensure_index_from_sequences([[""a"", ""a""], [""a"", ""b""]], names=[""L1"", ""L2""])
    MultiIndex([('a', 'a'),
                ('a', 'b')],
               names=['L1', 'L2'])

