"semdrift_drift_000657","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/utils/_testing.py","assert_allclose_dense_sparse","def assert_allclose_dense_sparse(x, y, rtol=1e-07, atol=1e-9, err_msg=""""):
    """"""Assert allclose for sparse and dense data.

