        L2 regularization term in the objective function
        ``(0.5 * alpha * || W ||_F^2)``.

    beta : float, default=0.
        L1 regularization term in the objective function
        ``(beta * || W ||_1)``. Only applied if ``is_saga`` is set to True.

    max_iter : int, default=1000
