"semdrift_drift_001316","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/decomposition/_pca.py","score_samples","def score_samples(self, X):
        """"""Return the log-likelihood of each sample.

        See. ""Pattern Recognition and Machine Learning""
        by C. Bishop, 12.2.1 p. 574
        or http://www.miketipping.com/papers/met-mppca.pdf

        Parameters
        ----------
        X : array-like of shape (n_samples, n_features)
            The data.

        Returns
        -------
        ll : ndarray of shape (n_samples,)
            Log-likelihood of each sample under the current model.
        """"""
        check_is_fitted(self)
        xp, _ = get_namespace(X)
        X = validate_data(self, X, dtype=[xp.float64, xp.float32], reset=False)
        Xr = X - self.mean_
        n_features = X.shape[1]
        precision = self.get_precision()
        log_like = -0.5 * xp.sum(Xr * (Xr @ precision), axis=1)
        log_like -= 0.5 * (n_features * log(2.0 * np.pi) - fast_logdet(precision))
        return log_like","See. ""Pattern Recognition and Machine Learning""
by C. Bishop, 12.2.1 p. 574
or http://www.miketipping.com/papers/met-mppca.pdf

Parameters
----------
X : array-like of shape (n_samples, n_features)
    The data.

