"semdrift_drift_000700","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/utils/random.py","_random_choice_csc","def _random_choice_csc(n_samples, classes, class_probability=None, random_state=None):
    """"""Generate a sparse random matrix given column class distributions

    Parameters
    ----------
