>>> xpx.cov(x, xp=xp)
Array(11.71, dtype=array_api_strict.float64)

>>> xpx.cov(y, xp=xp)
Array(2.14413333, dtype=array_api_strict.float64)

Input with more than two dimensions is treated as a stack of
two-dimensional input.

>>> stack = xp.stack((X, 2*X))
>>> xpx.cov(stack)
Array([[[ 11.71      ,  -4.286     ],
