"semdrift_drift_000427","scikit-learn","master_head","scikit-learn/sklearn/multioutput.py","fit","def fit(self, X, Y, **fit_params):
        """"""Fit the model to data matrix X and targets Y.

        Parameters
        ----------
        X : {array-like, sparse matrix} of shape (n_samples, n_features)
            The input data.

        Y : array-like of shape (n_samples, n_classes)
            The target values.

