"semdrift_drift_000356","scikit-learn","master_head","array_api_compat/common/_helpers.py","is_lazy_array","def is_lazy_array(x: object) -> TypeGuard[_ArrayApiObj]:
    """"""Return True if x is potentially a future or it may be otherwise impossible or
