"semdrift_drift_001382","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/linear_model/_ransac.py","fit","def fit(self, X, y, sample_weight=None, **fit_params):
        """"""Fit estimator using RANSAC algorithm.

        Parameters
        ----------
        X : {array-like, sparse matrix} of shape (n_samples, n_features)
            Training data.

        y : array-like of shape (n_samples,) or (n_samples, n_targets)
