"semdrift_drift_001042","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/linear_model/_coordinate_descent.py","fit","def fit(self, X, y, sample_weight=None, **params):
        """"""Fit model with internal cross-validation and with coordinate descent.

        Fit is on grid of alphas and best alpha estimated by cross-validation.

        Parameters
        ----------
