"semdrift_drift_002416","tornado","master_head","tornado/tornado/websocket.py","check_origin","def check_origin(self, origin: str) -> bool:
        """"""Override to enable support for allowing alternate origins.

        The ``origin`` argument is the value of the ``Origin`` HTTP header,
