"semdrift_clean_001901","urllib3","5ebe9bf","urllib3/dummyserver/testcase.py","consume_request","def consume_request(cls, sock: socket.socket, chunks: int = 65536) -> bytearray:
        """"""
        Consume a socket until after the HTTP request is sent.
        """"""
        consumed = bytearray()
        mark = cls._get_socket_mark(sock, True)
        while True:
            b = sock.recv(chunks)
            if not b:
                break
            consumed += b
            if consumed.endswith(mark):
                break
        return consumed","Consume a socket until after the HTTP request is sent.","0","none","Code implementation and docstring contract are fully synchronized.","train"
