"semdrift_drift_002304","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/utils/_indexing.py","_safe_assign","def _safe_assign(X, values, *, row_indexer=None, column_indexer=None):
    """"""Safe assignment to a numpy array, sparse matrix, or pandas dataframe.

