            new_lines (bool, optional): Padded lines should include ""\\n"". Defaults to False.

        Returns:
            List[List[Segment]]: New list of lines.
        """"""
        extra_lines = height - len(lines)
        if not extra_lines:
            return lines[:]
        lines = lines[:height]
