"semdrift_drift_001309","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/neural_network/_base.py","inplace_logistic_derivative","def inplace_logistic_derivative(Z, delta):
    """"""Apply the derivative of the logistic sigmoid function.

    It exploits the fact that the derivative is a simple function of the output
    value from logistic function.

    Parameters
    ----------
    Z : {array-like, sparse matrix}, shape (n_samples, n_features)
        The data which was output from the logistic activation function during
        the forward pass.

    delta : {array-like}, shape (n_samples, n_features)
         The backpropagated error signal to be modified inplace.
    """"""
    delta *= Z
    delta *= 1 - Z","Apply the derivative of the logistic sigmoid function.

