    -------
    completeness : float
       Score between 0.0 and 1.0. 1.0 stands for perfectly complete labeling.

    See Also
    --------
    homogeneity_score : Homogeneity metric of cluster labeling.
    v_measure_score : V-Measure (NMI with arithmetic mean option).

    References
    ----------

