    kernel : ndarray of shape (n_samples_X, n_samples_Y)
        The kernel matrix.

    Examples
    --------
    >>> from sklearn.metrics.pairwise import laplacian_kernel
    >>> X = [[0, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1]]
    >>> Y = [[1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 0]]
    >>> laplacian_kernel(X, Y)
