"semdrift_drift_000845","scikit-learn","master_head","linear_model/_glm/_newton_solver.py","line_search","def line_search(self, X, y, sample_weight):
        """"""Backtracking line search.

        Define

            phi(alpha) = loss(coef_old + alpha * coef_newton)

        Searches for a step length alpha satisfying the sufficient decrease (Armijo)
